[
  {
    "id": "57c27079f57c",
    "text": "Trust is not built on a single grand gesture.\nIt's forged in the quiet rhythm of consistency.\nNot the loud promise under a fleeting sky.\nBut the steady hand that always returns.\nNot the dramatic apology after the storm.\nBut the quiet effort to repair, day after day.\nPromises can fade like morning mist.\nChoose the steady presence that truly anchors.",
