  {
    "id": "12db97b65052",
    "text": "Is love the surge, or the steady current?\nIt's not the fireworks that burn out fast.\nIt's the quiet hum you lean into.\nIt's not the chase that leaves you breathless.\nIt's the comfortable silence that just feels right.\nIt does not demand grand gestures to prove itself.\nIt gives a gentle, consistent comfort.\nThat is the love that truly lasts.",
