  {
    "id": "fd21f9c4af69",
    "text": "Boundaries are not walls you build.\nThey are lines you draw, for yourself.\nThe discomfort is not your fault.\nGuilt tries to convince you to shrink.\nBut your 'no' is a quiet 'yes' to self.\nThose who respect you will understand.\nYour peace is not a burden to others.\nIt is the foundation of genuine connection.",
