  {
    "id": "eb4a72bb512f",
    "text": "Is genuine connection truly found in the constant pursuit?\nThe anxious wait for a reply, a sign, anything to bridge the gap.\nEach step forward feels like a heavier lift, unreciprocated.\nAre you listening, or am I just echoing my own needs into the void?\nDissecting every silence, every unreturned glance, for hidden meanings.\nThe quiet truth begins to surface: this chase is only for one.\nWhat if choosing stillness, instead of pursuit, is the strongest move?\nSometimes, the love you truly need is the one you give yourself by letting go.",
