  {
    "id": "9fafee7ee095",
    "text": "Softness is not fragility.\nIt is how the world enters.\nIt disarms what is harsh.\nYou learn who can hold it.\nHardness creates distance.\nChoose quiet authenticity.\nThe right ones seek your truth.\nYour softest places are strength.",
