  {
    "id": "5b3ee479ebd6",
    "text": "Does absence always mean silence?\nSometimes, the quiet screams volumes.\nThe space between us hums with unspoken truths.\nEvery quiet day is a conversation unhad.\nWhat’s not said often leaves the deepest marks.\nSilence can be a choice, a message, or a wound.\nListen closely; the quiet speaks of what’s truly gone.\nThe loudest goodbyes are sometimes never uttered.",
