  {
    "id": "9b27926c03f9",
    "text": "Is trust built on promises, or patterns?\nEmpty words ring hollow, soon forgotten.\nGrand declarations fade; small acts remain.\nSafety comes from what they consistently do.\nReal commitment shows up, day after day.\nTheir steady presence is the true promise.\nInconsistency crumbles everything they once said.\nTrust the quiet actions, not loud words.",
