  {
    "id": "ade49bc7261c",
    "text": "I mistook grand promises for true foundations.\nMy heart chased future declarations' echo.\nBelieving loud words held tangible weight.\nConsistent absence eroded every loud vow.\nTrue trust isn't dramatic pronouncements.\nIt’s the persistent, unremarkable daily act.\nMy peace rests on relentless follow-through.\nNot fleeting thunder of an empty promise.\nThis quiet rhythm settles my deepest doubts.",
