  {
    "id": "7f3ae64f630e",
    "text": "I always heard the loud words.\nBig promises hung in air.\nI waited, holding my breath.\nStill, nothing ever happened.\nThen I truly started seeing.\nThe grand vows meant nothing.\nHe just kept bringing coffee.\nEvery single, quiet morning.\nThat small, steady act built it.",
