  {
    "id": "fff8e7ac70f3",
    "text": "He promised me forever twice.\nI counted every single word.\nWords piled up like receipts.\nNothing in the fridge changed.\nThen one gray Tuesday morning.\nHe just made the coffee.\nNo speech, just two cups.\nSame cups, every gray morning.\nNow I trust the cups.",
